{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791430/extras/bfcaef56e25bef141e79a35415fd473b.webp?t=1753102716\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791430/extras/bfcaef56e25bef141e79a35415fd473b.poster.avif?t=1753102716\" class=\"bb_img\" width=459 height=225 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791430/extras/312030f1f1cc31b7867b24d50af52327.avif?t=1753102716\" width=600 height=105 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Official Soundtrack for the game &quot;Sapo Xul\u00e9 e o Casamento Indesejado&quot; is inspired by the children's song &quot;O Sapo N\u00e3o Lava o P\u00e9&quot;, which gave rise to the idea for the character Sapo Xul\u00e9. But the compositions go much further, taking the player on a true journey through the different locations of Lagoa Feliz, the world of the game. Embark on this adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791430/extras/9c221baf3d9969f2151ad91ca1f6ff2e.avif?t=1753102716\" width=600 height=105 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recorded at Salamandratra studio between 2022 and 2025</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mixing and Mastering: Nelton Matioli</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Editing: Leandro Matioli</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project Design: Johnny Vila (Squash Studios)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arts: Paulo Jos\u00e9</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Graphic Design: Diogo Rodarte</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as